// A number and a string, written as such, under arithmetic: TL++'s
// compiler refuses it, "Incompatible types between N and C" (probe xdp, on
// 24.3.1.9); AdvPL's takes it, and so does xc in a .prw.
User Function Mixed()
  Local n := 0
  n := 1 + "a"
  n := "a" * 2
  n := 1 + 2
  n := "a" + "b"
Return n
